    "Pressure and air-volume diagnostics remain unresolved.",
    "Measured initial speed is about one quarter of ideal Bernoulli speed; absolute speed is not calibrated.",
    "One interrupted run misses the final ten-second speed target through backward oscillation. All three interrupted runs change receiver source inventory by less than 0.5% over their final minute. The water is not certified quiescent.",
